{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The recovery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As I was cleaning my old house's ceiling while moving out, I came across this curious CD case. Intrigued by the premise of the software, I was able to recover and run it on my pc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this software</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectrasimulatia</strong> is  made by Visionaria\u2122 and never released to the public.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476020/extras/f44a7716152ecb935695eecb3ecaf62d.poster.avif?t=1757366757\" aria-label=\"Visionaria bootsplash\" width=668 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476020/extras/f44a7716152ecb935695eecb3ecaf62d.webm?t=1757366757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476020/extras/f44a7716152ecb935695eecb3ecaf62d.mp4?t=1757366757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quoted from the manual, this program\u00a0<strong>&quot;renders anomalies in signals\u2019 frequency spectra as 3D simulations&quot;</strong>, whatever that means. The console has a <strong>terminal</strong> to input commands, a <strong>screen</strong> to render the simulation, a bar that measures the <strong>simulation instability level</strong>, and other options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476020/extras/f5de60a560ce14de3cbe41a80bf1c1bd.avif?t=1757366757\" alt=\"Console\" width=668 height=376 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The software comes with some <strong>tools</strong>\u00a0to interact in the simulations\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476020/extras/55c2da47f360604bda73ad23147a27c1.avif?t=1757366757\" alt=\"Pointer tool\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476020/extras/afec69afe9440a4f0c11f7d3fec76e7b.avif?t=1757366757\" alt=\"Compass tool\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enviroments and entities to connect to through frequencies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developers' notes to find scattered across the simulations offering insights into the software\u2019s creation... and hints of something more</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3476020?t=1757366757","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3476020?t=1757366757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476020/8e18ae7c12dcdfbdcac1765f32b7b1f638c84750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757366757","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476020/8e18ae7c12dcdfbdcac1765f32b7b1f638c84750/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757366757","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The recovery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As I was cleaning my old house's ceiling while moving out, I came across this curious CD case. Intrigued by the premise of the